    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111616" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλοψῡχ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>love of life,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλοψυχίην ἀναιρέεται</span> he
