			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὴ μεντἄν με φ. ἔχοι,
			εἰ</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				37c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλοψυχίας ἕνεκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					944f
				</span></i>
			.</div>
